The GeoIP Update program performs automatic updates of GeoIP2 and
GeoLite2 binary databases from MaxMind.

To use geoipupdate, configure /etc/GeoIP.conf with your MaxMind
AccountID and LicenseKey (free registration at maxmind.com).
The database files are stored by default in /usr/share/GeoIP.

For client application, it would need libmaxminddb to use the
GeoIP2 db.
